WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.416 --> 00:00:02.375
I played in Boston
so many times.

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:03.750
The history speaks for itself.

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:04.750
But for this one time,

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.791
when I went to Boston
for this game six,

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.625
I felt absolutely nothing.

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.125
I don't think many people
would ever think about that game

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.875
when they would think
about my career.

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.708
But for me, that was the one.

00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:21.250
When the pressure is higher,
when more is on the line,

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.916
it's even more important
that you perform.

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:24.750
Everything's just clicking.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.125
You're winning. You know, 
don't mess this up.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:30.125
This perfect day now is just
turning into this nightmare.

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.333
Breaks down frame
by frame in my head.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.333
It's like a camera.

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:36.333
If I make a mistake, bam!
This is where it happened.

00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:37.291
I can tell you everything.

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.791
I had a full on breakdown,

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.625
'cause I realized
what was on the line now.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.125
I started crying,

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.541
and then I had to go
out and compete.

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:45.166
That's when it dawns on me.

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.416
I don't care what happens.

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:48.833
Why not just go for it?

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:56.166
We did something that
I'm still trying to repeat today.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.791
I was able to win
a championship that year.

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.541
That was the result
of feeling nothing.

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:02.166
You just do it.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.541
You become it.

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:05.458
I can feel my momentum
picking up.

00:01:05.541 --> 00:01:06.500
Ah, this looks good.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.833
You're in rhythm with each other
like you have the same pulse.

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:13.583
They're calling you
the greatest athlete in the world.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.708
You think about
this whole lifetime

00:01:15.791 --> 00:01:17.333
all building 
to this one moment...

00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:18.833
I couldn't believe
it was happening.

00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:23.791
I wish I can bottle nothing up.
I'll tell you that. 

